# Logs
*.log
logs/
# …except captured log EXCERPTS that are test fixtures. Without this negation a fixture named
# *.log is written, the self-test passes locally against it, and `git add` silently leaves it
# behind — which is exactly how scripts/__fixtures__/fan-in-suite-lint-failure.log went missing
# while tasks/gap-quay-suite-attribution-regex-zero-coverage.md declared it as delivered.
!scripts/__fixtures__/*.log

